lang=\"EN-US\">1. 재입학 대상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">대학원, 산업대학원 및 교육대학원 석/사과정에 재학 중 자퇴, 미등록 또는 미복학 등으로 제적된 자 중 재입학을 희망하는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 재입학 추진일정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 재입학원서 접수기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 7. 10(화) ～ 7. 13(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 재입학 신청장소 : 각 학과(전공) 행정사무실 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 재입학 허가일 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 8. 7(화)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 수강신청일 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 2012. 8. 13(월) ～ 8. 17(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 등록기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 8. 27(월) ～ 8. 30(목)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 재입학 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 재입학 원서 1부&lt;소정서식&gt;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 각서 1부&lt;소정서식&gt;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 지도교수 추천서 1부&lt;소정서식&gt;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 학적부 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 기타사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 재입학자가 기 취득한 학점 및 성적은 그대로 인정한다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">징계에 의하여 제적된 자와 재학연한을 초과한 자는 재입학을 할 수 없다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">재입학이 허가된 자는 기일내에 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">등록금 납부 등 학적제반 절차를 이행</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">하여야 한다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TE